{"2118900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sonorous | Deep Down Below", "steam_appid": 2118900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "The X-2HX virus, eradicated human life on inhabited soil forcing life on the open sea. <br><br>You play as Matthew Cole, a lead bioengineer working on “Sonorous” - a low frequency cure to eradicate the virus from the soil - alongside scientists from around the globe onboard the &quot;Fortune&quot;, a floating military research facility.<br><br>The only problem – The &quot;Fortune&quot; got shipwrecked in the deep sea, with humanities only hope onboard.<br><br>You survived. Your mission: Stay alive and find a way to retrieve Sonorous in an everlasting battle against starvation, thirst and ruthless enemies!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118900/extras/bc630c51fd76c2898ae37aa90b5da8d0.webp?t=1787305697\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118900/extras/9ce0af9ed50760cda671de07d8028d98.webp?t=1787305697\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br>Discover new environments, wildlife and resources as you step into the unknown and search for “Sonorous” in an open world - at land and especially underwater!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118900/extras/3119aee967b6d22b9bb2e7a5e193764e.webp?t=1787305697\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br>Craft weapons, food, resources, tools and much more to aid you in your survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118900/extras/9c1bfe84a2ea350d703704f4a433fde0.webp?t=1787305697\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br>Use discovered &amp; crafted weapons to hunt a range of fish or use your skills to craft structures capable of supplying you with your needs! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118900/extras/1d0da7e72146bcca24e48eb2313cb5c0.webp?t=1787305697\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br>Build and upgrade your base with a range of utilities such as firepits, storage units, tables and many more! You decide what, where and when to build!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118900/extras/f3c2f7929b8a733f5373eb69beb78dda.webp?t=1787305697\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br>Find nutrition, stay hydrated and limit your injuries. Defend yourself against roaming scavengers looting for resources and a range of wildlife and unknown creatures.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118900/extras/a0bdc3ac5411e85b62da855eaba6e7c6.webp?t=1787305697\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br>Fighting for survival will improve your abilities over time to go further and deeper, bringing you closer to finding “Sonorous.”", "about_the_game": "The X-2HX virus, eradicated human life on inhabited soil forcing life on the open sea. <br><br>You play as Matthew Cole, a lead bioengineer working on “Sonorous” - a low frequency cure to eradicate the virus from the soil - alongside scientists from around the globe onboard the &quot;Fortune&quot;, a floating military research facility.<br><br>The only problem – The &quot;Fortune&quot; got shipwrecked in the deep sea, with humanities only hope onboard.<br><br>You survived. Your mission: Stay alive and find a way to retrieve Sonorous in an everlasting battle against starvation, thirst and ruthless enemies!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shar